Re-tendering may be resorted to only after the administrative approval of one step higher than the Competent Authority (limited to Unit Head) for ordering under the circumstances such as:
(a) Inadequate response / Lack of Competition (refer note below);
(b) Unreasonably high/ low price;
(c) Suspected cartel formation;
(d) Sudden slump in market prices;
(e) Major changes in scope and/ or pre-qualif
